  "privacy_policy": "Privacy Policy (GDPR)",
  "terms_of_service_content": "General Terms and Conditions for DJs – VibesBox\nAs of: 12 February 2026 | Version: 1.0\nProvider: VibesBox by Swen Steller, Neefestr. 9, 09119 Chemnitz\nEmail: info@vibesbox.app\n\n1. Scope\nThese General Terms and Conditions (GTC) apply to the use of the VibesBox mobile application by DJs.\n\n2. Participation requirements\nUse of the app as a DJ is permitted only to persons of full age (18 years and over). Registration with a valid email address is required.\n\n3. Description of services\nThe app enables DJs to create events and manage music requests. Features include: creating events, managing requests, blocking guests, statistics and push notifications.\n\n4. Memberships and subscriptions\nThere are free (limited) and paid models. Prices and scope are displayed in the app. Payments are made via the respective app store. The store providers' terms and conditions also apply.\n\n5. Right of withdrawal\nDJs have a 14-day right of withdrawal for subscriptions. Withdrawal by email to info@vibesbox.app. Refunds are made in accordance with store guidelines.\n\n6. Third-party interfaces (Spotify & Shazam)\nThe app uses third-party APIs:\n- Spotify: Search for metadata (title/artist). No music playback via the app.\n- Shazam: Automatic music recognition.\nThe provider assumes no liability for the accuracy of results (e.g. incorrectly identified songs) or failures of these interfaces.\n\n7. Obligations of the DJ\nThe DJ is responsible for content and interaction with guests. Illegal content is prohibited. The DJ is liable for legal violations arising from their use.\n\n8. Liability of the provider\nThe provider does not guarantee constant availability or accept liability for data loss due to force majeure. Liability is limited to intent and gross negligence.\n\n9. Data protection\nData processing is carried out in accordance with the separate privacy policy for DJs.\n\n10. Changes to services\nThe provider reserves the right to make functional or price adjustments. Changes will be communicated 4 weeks in advance.\n\n11. Termination and blocking\nTermination is possible at any time via the app or by email. The provider may block accounts for violations without prior notice.\n\n12. Intellectual property rights\nThe app is protected by copyright. Reverse engineering or reproduction is prohibited.\n\n13. Final provisions\nThe law of the Federal Republic of Germany applies. Place of jurisdiction is Chemnitz.",
